+config NOVA_RK3399_MAINLINE
+	bool "Step 2: TPL, SPL and TF-A BL31 of our own load it from the card"
+	select SHA1
+	select OF_BOARD_SETUP
+	select OF_BOARD_SETUP_EXTENDED
+	help
+	  The whole chain from source: TPL (the LPDDR4 init) and SPL at
+	  card LBA 64, this U-Boot proper and TF-A's BL31 as u-boot.itb at
+	  LBA 2048. `nova boot` does what the scope's systems expect of
+	  their loader -- the reboot flag in PMUGRF OS_REG0, Run/Stop at
